{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2019-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1573862400, "end_date": 1574467199, "month_true_total": 130, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:57:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "57646801", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066212247", "personaname": "Whodidunickabollockov", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198066212247/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 484, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 484, "last_played": 1574444223, "avatar": "142595ca68ab27733fc73e64039be63660c32e29"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warhammer 40k Space Marine is a fairly fun game.\nI am a newcomer to the 40k universe, and so my knowledge of the universe is very limited, though I have been looking up the wiki's and watching videos about the lore and such. But overall I have the gist of the factions, and the background of terminology and lore.\n\nSo I enjoyed this game. The gameplay though a tad arcadey (but that was the norm back in the early 2010's) was still fun and punchy. I like the variety of weapons, from a long ranged lasgun (A powerful sniper) to a close-up and personal meltagun (A powerful shotgun?) as well as all the melee weapons. Good old fun.\n\nI found the narrative to be interesting though there are a few cliches that I didin't like (not gunna spoil them), as well as a few missed opportunities to showcase other elements of the 40K universe, like I genuinely thought they were gunna introduce a Dreadnaught, but unfortunately that never came to be (sorry for that sorta spoiler not-spoiler, but it is better to be told sooner rather than get disappointed later).\n\nI liked the character of Titus, and how stalwart and honourable he is. He was a good character to play as.\n\nDon't bother with any of the dlc, essentially the game's online function is dead. So no you can't play with your friends killing Orks and the like online. \n\nAll in all, a fun game, would recommend. Though don't expect it to be a masterpiece, as it really is not so. It is a good game, Though I would wait for it to be on sale like I did. £19.99 is a tad too high of a price, especially for the game of its age and current status.", "timestamp_created": 1574445503, "timestamp_updated": 1574445503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57586992", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053740483", "personaname": "Frost Wraith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/frostywraith/", "num_games_owned": 185, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 361, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 194, "last_played": 1580120317, "avatar": "6042643e43b7975f69fa9fb078b32daf4b1fdcb2"}, "language": "english", "review": "BLOOD FOR THE BLOOD GOD", "timestamp_created": 1574350589, "timestamp_updated": 1574350589, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57557055", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003008810", "personaname": "Big Mac Tit Slap", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003008810/", "num_games_owned": 133, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3061, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2682, "last_played": 1574377925, "avatar": "d9849caa38e53b3e01247003ca533a1335337789"}, "language": "english", "review": "ebic hehe", "timestamp_created": 1574294053, 